       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. HELLO-WORLD.

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-NAME PIC A(30).
       01 WS-GREETING PIC A(60).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-LOGIC SECTION.
           PERFORM INITIALIZE-DATA
           PERFORM PROCESS-GREETING
           PERFORM DISPLAY-RESULT
           STOP RUN.

       INITIALIZE-DATA.
           MOVE "World" TO WS-NAME.

       PROCESS-GREETING.
           STRING "Hello, " DELIMITED SIZE
                  WS-NAME DELIMITED SPACE
                  "!" DELIMITED SIZE
                  INTO WS-GREETING.

       DISPLAY-RESULT.
           DISPLAY WS-GREETING.

       CALL-EXTERNAL SECTION.
           CALL 'UTIL-PROGRAM' USING WS-NAME.

       COPY-SECTION SECTION.
           COPY COMMON-DEFS.
